        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/495429?u=2f3b9dd03c6c4a961d44a632fe1976c73fa19e1f&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Updates Firefox support for <code class=\"notranslate\">AudioParam.{exponential,linear}RampToValueAtTime()</code>, indicating that it is not fully supported.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Also refines the Chrome notes.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Evidence provided by <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/s0rent/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/s0rent\">@s0rent</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27568\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27568/hovercard\">this issue</a>.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Reverts <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2889506441\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/26092\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/26092/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/26092\">#26092</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #27568.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3315393502\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27568\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27568/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27568\">#27568</a>.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28872",
            "title": "Firefox only partially supports `AudioParam`'s ramp methods",
            "date_modified": "2026-01-20T22:22:01.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-01-20T14:53:53.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "caugner",
                "url": "https://github.com/caugner"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64103?u=428d3c27c9cd7efc648e17dfe5a4321c3f8e44d2&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The <code class=\"notranslate\">display-mode</code> CSS media query has several values (e.g., <code class=\"notranslate\">display-mode: browser</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">display-mode: fullscreen</code>). Support for those values specifically was previously locked in notes; this PR busts them out.</p>\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">For the most part, I trusted these web platform tests to determine if a browser is <em>aware</em> of a value (i.e., to determine if <code class=\"notranslate\">(display-mode: made-up-example)</code> is functionally equivalent to <code class=\"notranslate\">not all</code>):</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://wpt.live/css/mediaqueries/display-mode.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://wpt.live/css/mediaqueries/display-mode.html</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wpt.live/css/mediaqueries/display-mode.tentative.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://wpt.live/css/mediaqueries/display-mode.tentative.html</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">For non-partial \"is always true\" notes, I mostly used the existing BCD on <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/Progressive_web_apps/Manifest/Reference/display#browser_compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\">the <code class=\"notranslate\">display</code> manifest member</a> to determine what to expect (e.g., if a browser doesn't implement <code class=\"notranslate\">minimal-ui</code>, then <code class=\"notranslate\">display-mode: minimal-ui</code> is always false, even though it may be a valid media query).</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">For the remaining notes and partials, I relied on bugs and prior discussion on this repo. In some cases (e.g., <a href=\"https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=216395\" rel=\"nofollow\">WebKit bug 216395</a>), I used the information in a bug to make a determination, but did not actually treat it as a bug (e.g., Safari <em>shouldn't</em>, by specification, compute <code class=\"notranslate\">display-mode: fullscreen</code> to true for a fullscreen window with tabs UI).</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Some of this is very difficult to test (e.g., some behavior is specific to installed PWAs), so I didn't test this comprehensively. I suspect some of this is a little wonky or off, but it's more explicit now and will be easier to maintain in the future.</p>\n\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #18807.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"1566502743\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/18807\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/18807/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/18807\">#18807</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #26677.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3032420087\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/26677\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/26677/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/26677\">#26677</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"1409530994\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/web-platform-tests/interop/issues/218\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/web-platform-tests/interop/issues/218/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/web-platform-tests/interop/issues/218\">web-platform-tests/interop#218</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"699472536\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/w3c/manifest/issues/934\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/w3c/manifest/issues/934/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/w3c/manifest/issues/934\">w3c/manifest#934</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=216395\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=216395</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n",
